@k.words.zeus.noun.1 k.words.sense word=Zeus pos=noun n=1 gloss="(Greek mythology) the supreme god of ancient Greek mythology; son of Rhea and Cronus whom he dethroned; husband and brother of Hera; brother of Poseidon and Hades; father of many gods; counterpart of Roman Jupiter" instance_of="Greek deity" core.source="wordnet 3.1"
